ls.navRainbowSection.title":t=>`Couleurs arc-en-ciel : ${t}`,"modals.folderSuggest.placeholder":t=>`Déplacer ${t} vers le dossier...`,"modals.folderSuggest.multipleFilesLabel":t=>`${t} fichiers`}},id:{dateFormat:"D MMM YYYY",timeFormat:"HH:mm",defaultVaultProfileName:"Default",bootstrap:{downloading:"Mengunduh bahasa…",continueInEnglish:"Lanjutkan dalam bahasa Inggris",downloadFailed:"Unduhan bahasa gagal. Notebook Navigator menggunakan bahasa Inggris."},formatters:{"paneHeader.applySortAndGroupToDescendants":t=>`Terapkan urutan dan grup ke ${t}`,"paneHeader.applyAppearanceToDescendants":t=>`Terapkan tampilan ke ${t}`,"paneHeader.resetAppearanceInDescendants":t=>`Atur ulang tampilan di ${t}`,"folderAppearance.titleRows.option":t=>`${t} baris judul`,"folderAppearance.previewRows.option":t=>`${t} baris pratinjau`,"modals.bulkApply.applySortAndGroupTitle":t=>`Terapkan urutan dan grup ke ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceTitle":t=>`Terapkan tampilan ke ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceTitle":t=>`Atur ulang tampilan di ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceMessage":(t,e)=>`Tampilan akan berubah untuk ${t} item. Tampilan khusus yang ada dan diganti: ${e}. Preferensi tampilan tersimpan disalin satu kali; pengurutan dan pengelompokan dipertahankan. Perubahan mendatang dan turunan baru tidak ditautkan.`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceMessage":t=>`Tampilan akan diatur ulang untuk ${t} item. Pengurutan dan pengelompokan dipertahankan. Ini adalah perubahan satu kali; perubahan mendatang dan turunan baru tidak ditautkan.`,"modals.bulkApply.affectedCountMessage":t=>`Penimpaan yang ada dan akan berubah: ${t}.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.propertySortMessage":(t,e)=>`Ini akan mengalihkan tampilan saat ini ke urutan manual menggunakan "${t}". Mengedit urutan akan menulis nilai indeks numerik ke properti tersebut di ${e} catatan sesuai kebutuhan.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.removePropertyMessage":(t,e)=>`Ini akan menghapus "${t}" dari ${e} catatan di daftar saat ini. Urutan manual akan dihapus untuk catatan tersebut.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.compactMessage":t=>`Pengaturan ulang ini memerlukan lebih banyak ruang numerik. ${t} catatan akan menerima nilai indeks baru.`,"modals.navRainbowSection.title":t=>`Warna pelangi: ${t}`,"modals.folderSuggest.placeholder":t=>`Pindahkan ${t} ke folder...`,"modals.folderSuggest.multipleFilesLabel":t=>`${t} file`}},it:{dateFormat:"D MMM YYYY",timeFormat:"HH:mm",defaultVaultProfileName:"Predefinito",bootstrap:{downloading:"Download delle lingue…",continueInEnglish:"Continua in inglese",downloadFailed:"Download delle lingue non riuscito. Notebook Navigator usa l’inglese."},formatters:{"paneHeader.applySortAndGroupToDescendants":t=>`Applica ordinamento e raggruppamento a ${t}`,"paneHeader.applyAppearanceToDescendants":t=>`Applica aspetto a ${t}`,"paneHeader.resetAppearanceInDescendants":t=>`Reimposta aspetto in ${t}`,"folderAppearance.titleRows.option":t=>`${t} ${t===1?"riga":"righe"} titolo`,"folderAppearance.previewRows.option":t=>`${t} ${t===1?"riga":"righe"} anteprima`,"modals.bulkApply.applySortAndGroupTitle":t=>`Applicare ordinamento e raggruppamento a ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceTitle":t=>`Applicare aspetto a ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceTitle":t=>`Reimpostare aspetto in ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceMessage":(t,e)=>`L'aspetto cambierà per ${t} ${t===1?"elemento":"elementi"}. Aspetti personalizzati esistenti sostituiti: ${e}. Le preferenze di aspetto salvate vengono copiate una sola volta; ordinamento e raggruppamento restano invariati. Le modifiche future e i nuovi discendenti non sono collegati.`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceMessage":t=>`L'aspetto verrà reimpostato per ${t} ${t===1?"elemento":"elementi"}. Ordinamento e raggruppamento restano invariati. È una modifica una tantum; le modifiche future e i nuovi discendenti non sono collegati.`,"modals.bulkApply.affectedCountMessage":t=>`Sostituzioni esistenti che cambieranno: ${t}.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.propertySortMessage":(t,e)=>`Questo cambia la vista corrente all'ordinamento manuale usando "${t}". La modifica dell'ordine scrive valori indice numerici in quella proprietà in ${e} ${e===1?"nota":"note"} secondo necessità.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.removePropertyMessage":(t,e)=>`Questo rimuove "${t}" da ${e} ${e===1?"nota":"note"} nella lista corrente. L'ordinamento manuale verrà cancellato per quelle note.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.compactMessage":t=>`Questo riordino richiede più spazio numerico. ${t} ${t===1?"nota riceverà":"note riceveranno"} nuovi valori indice.`,"modals.navRainbowSection.title":t=>`Colori arcobaleno: ${t}`,"modals.folderSuggest.placeholder":t=>`Sposta ${t} nella cartella...`,"modals.folderSuggest.multipleFilesLabel":t=>`${t} file`}},ja:{dateFormat:"YYYY年M月D日",timeFormat:"HH:mm",defaultVaultProfileName:"デフォルト",bootstrap:{downloading:"言語をダウンロード中…",continueInEnglish:"英語で続行",downloadFailed:"言語のダウンロードに失敗しました。Notebook Navigator は英語を使用しています。"},formatters:{"paneHeader.applySortAndGroupToDescendants":t=>`${t}に並べ替えとグループ化を適用`,"paneHeader.applyAppearanceToDescendants":t=>`${t}に外観を適用`,"paneHeader.resetAppearanceInDescendants":t=>`${t}の外観をリセット`,"folderAppearance.titleRows.option":t=>`タイトル${t}行`,"folderAppearance.previewRows.option":t=>`プレビュー${t}行`,"modals.bulkApply.applySortAndGroupTitle":t=>`${t}に並べ替えとグループ化を適用しますか？`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceTitle":t=>`${t}に外観を適用しますか？`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceTitle":t=>`${t}の外観をリセットしますか？`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceMessage":(t,e)=>`${t}件の外観が変更されます。既存のカスタム外観の置換数：${e}。保存済みの外観設定が一度だけコピーされ、並べ替えとグループ化は保持されます。今後の変更や新しい子項目は連動しません。`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceMessage":t=>`${t}件の外観がリセットされます。並べ替えとグループ化は保持されます。これは一度限りの変更で、今後の変更や新しい子項目は連動しません。`,"modals.bulkApply.affectedCountMessage":t=>`変更される既存のオーバーライド: ${t}。`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.propertySortMessage":(t,e)=>`現在のビューを「${t}」を使った手動並べ替えに切り替えます。並び順を編集すると、必要に応じて ${e} 件のノートのそのプロパティに数値インデックス値が書き込まれます。`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.removePropertyMessage":(t,e)=>`現在のリストの ${e} 件のノートから「${t}」を削除します。それらのノートの手動並べ替え順はクリアされます。`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.compactMessage":t=>`この並べ替えにはより多くの数値領域が必要です。${t} 件のノートに新しいインデックス値が割り当てられます。`,"modals.navRainbowSection.title":t=>`レインボーカラー: ${t}`,"modals.folderSuggest.placeholder":t=>`${t} をフォルダに移動...`,"modals.folderSuggest.multipleFilesLabel":t=>`${t} 個のファイル`}},ko:{dateFormat:"YYYY년 M월 D일",timeFormat:"a h:mm",defaultVaultProfileName:"기본",bootstrap:{downloading:"언어 다운로드 중…",continueInEnglish:"영어로 계속",downloadFailed:"언어를 다운로드하지 못했습니다. Notebook Navigator가 영어를 사용합니다."},formatters:{"paneHeader.applySortAndGroupToDescendants":t=>`${t}에 정렬 및 그룹 적용`,"paneHeader.applyAppearanceToDescendants":t=>`${t}에 모양 적용`,"paneHeader.resetAppearanceInDescendants":t=>`${t}의 모양 재설정`,"folderAppearance.titleRows.option":t=>`${t}개 제목 행`,"folderAppearance.previewRows.option":t=>`${t}개 미리보기 행`,"modals.bulkApply.applySortAndGroupTitle":t=>`${t}에 정렬 및 그룹을 적용하시겠습니까?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceTitle":t=>`${t}에 모양을 적용하시겠습니까?`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceTitle":t=>`${t}의 모양을 재설정하시겠습니까?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceMessage":(t,e)=>`${t}개 항목의 모양이 변경됩니다. 교체되는 기존 사용자 지정 모양: ${e}개. 저장된 모양 설정이 한 번 복사되며 정렬과 그룹화는 유지됩니다. 이후 변경 사항과 새 하위 항목은 연결되지 않습니다.`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceMessage":t=>`${t}개 항목의 모양이 재설정됩니다. 정렬과 그룹화는 유지됩니다. 일회성 변경이며 이후 변경 사항과 새 하위 항목은 연결되지 않습니다.`,"modals.bulkApply.affectedCountMessage":t=>`변경될 기존 재정의: ${t}.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.propertySortMessage":(t,e)=>`현재 보기를 "${t}"을(를) 사용한 수동 정렬로 전환합니다. 순서를 편집하면 필요에 따라 ${e}개 노트의 해당 속성에 숫자 인덱스 값이 기록됩니다.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.removePropertyMessage":(t,e)=>`현재 목록의 ${e}개 노트에서 "${t}"을(를) 제거합니다. 해당 노트의 수동 정렬 순서가 초기화됩니다.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.compactMessage":t=>`이 재정렬에는 더 많은 숫자 공간이 필요합니다. ${t}개 노트에 새로운 인덱스 값이 할당됩니다.`,"modals.navRainbowSection.title":t=>`무지개 색상: ${t}`,"modals.folderSuggest.placeholder":t=>`${t}을(를) 폴더로 이동...`,"modals.folderSuggest.multipleFilesLabel":t=>`${t}개의 파일`}},nl:{dateFormat:"D MMM YYYY",timeFormat:"HH:mm",defaultVaultProfileName:"Standaard",bootstrap:{downloading:"Talen downloaden…",continueInEnglish:"Doorgaan in het Engels",downloadFailed:"Talen downloaden mislukt. Notebook Navigator gebruikt Engels."},formatters:{"paneHeader.applySortAndGroupToDescendants":t=>`Sortering en groepering toepassen op ${t}`,"paneHeader.applyAppearanceToDescendants":t=>`Uiterlijk toepassen op ${t}`,"paneHeader.resetAppearanceInDescendants":t=>`Uiterlijk in ${t} herstellen`,"folderAppearance.titleRows.option":t=>`${t} titelrij${t===1?"":"en"}`,"folderAppearance.previewRows.option":t=>`${t} voorbeeldrij${t===1?"":"en"}`,"modals.bulkApply.applySortAndGroupTitle":t=>`Sortering en groepering toepassen op ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceTitle":t=>`Uiterlijk toepassen op ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceTitle":t=>`Uiterlijk in ${t} herstellen?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceMessage":(t,e)=>`Het uiterlijk verandert voor ${t} ${t===1?"item":"items"}. Bestaande aangepaste uiterlijkinstellingen vervangen: ${e}. Opgeslagen voorkeuren voor uiterlijk worden eenmaal gekopieerd; sortering en groepering blijven behouden. Toekomstige wijzigingen en nieuwe onderliggende items worden niet gekoppeld.`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceMessage":t=>`Het uiterlijk wordt hersteld voor ${t} ${t===1?"item":"items"}. Sortering en groepering blijven behouden. Dit is een eenmalige wijziging; toekomstige wijzigingen en nieuwe onderliggende items worden niet gekoppeld.`,"modals.bulkApply.affectedCountMessage":t=>`Bestaande overschrijvingen die wijzigen: ${t}.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.propertySortMessage":(t,e)=>`Dit schakelt de huidige weergave over naar handmatig sorteren met "${t}". Bij het bewerken van de volgorde worden indien nodig numerieke indexwaarden naar die eigenschap geschreven in ${e} ${e===1?"notitie":"notities"}.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.removePropertyMessage":(t,e)=>`Dit verwijdert "${t}" uit ${e} ${e===1?"notitie":"notities"} in de huidige lijst. Voor die notities wordt de handmatige sorteervolgorde gewist.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.compactMessage":t=>`Deze herordening heeft meer numerieke ruimte nodig. ${t} ${t===1?"notitie krijgt":"notities krijgen"} nieuwe indexwaarden.`,"modals.navRainbowSection.title":t=>`Regenboogkleuren: ${t}`,"modals.folderSuggest.placeholder":t=>`Verplaats ${t} naar map...`,"modals.folderSuggest.multipleFilesLabel":t=>`${t} bestanden`}},pl:{dateFormat:"DD.MM.YYYY",timeFormat:"HH:mm",defaultVaultProfileName:"Domyślny",bootstrap:{downloading:"Pobieranie języków…",continueInEnglish:"Kontynuuj po angielsku",downloadFailed:"Nie udało się pobrać języków. Notebook Navigator używa języka angielskiego."},formatters:{"paneHeader.applySortAndGroupToDescendants":t=>`Zastosuj sortowanie i grupowanie dla ${t}`,"paneHeader.applyAppearanceToDescendants":t=>`Zastosuj wygląd dla ${t}`,"paneHeader.resetAppearanceInDescendants":t=>`Zresetuj wygląd dla ${t}`,"folderAppearance.titleRows.option":t=>`${t} ${t===1?"wiersz":t===2||t===3||t===4?"wiersze":"wierszy"} tytułu`,"folderAppearance.previewRows.option":t=>`${t} ${t===1?"wiersz":t===2||t===3||t===4?"wiersze":"wierszy"} podglądu`,"modals.bulkApply.applySortAndGroupTitle":t=>`Zastosuj sortowanie i grupowanie dla ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceTitle":t=>`Zastosuj wygląd dla ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceTitle":t=>`Zresetować wygląd dla ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceMessage":(t,e)=>`Wygląd zmieni się dla ${t} ${t===1?"elementu":"elementów"}. Zastąpione istniejące niestandardowe wyglądy: ${e}. Zapisane preferencje wyglądu zostaną skopiowane jednorazowo; sortowanie i grupowanie pozostaną bez zmian. Przyszłe zmiany i nowe elementy podrzędne nie będą połączone.`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceMessage":t=>`Wygląd zostanie zresetowany dla ${t} ${t===1?"elementu":"elementów"}. Sortowanie i grupowanie pozostaną bez zmian. Jest to jednorazowa zmiana; przyszłe zmiany i nowe elementy podrzędne nie będą połączone.`,"modals.bulkApply.affectedCountMessage":t=>`Istniejące nadpisania do zmiany: ${t}.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.propertySortMessage":(t,e)=>`Przełącza bieżący widok na sortowanie ręczne z użyciem „${t}”. Edycja kolejności w razie potrzeby zapisuje wartości indeksu liczbowego do tego atrybutu w ${e} ${e===1?"notatce":"notatkach"}.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.removePropertyMessage":(t,e)=>`Usuwa „${t}” z ${e} ${e===1?"notatki":"notatek"} na bieżącej liście. Kolejność sortowania ręcznego zostanie wyczyszczona dla tych notatek.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.compactMessage":t=>`Ta zmiana kolejności wymaga więcej miejsca na wartości liczbowe. ${t} ${t===1?"notatka otrzyma":t%10>=2&&t%10<=4&&(t%100<12||t%100>14)?"notatki otrzymają":"notatek otrzyma"} nowe wartości indeksu.`,"modals.navRainbowSection.title":t=>`Kolory tęczy: ${t}`,"modals.folderSuggest.placeholder":t=>`Przenieś ${t} do folderu...`,"modals.folderSuggest.multipleFilesLabel":t=>`${t} ${t===1?"plik":t%10>=2&&t%10<=4&&(t%100<12||t%100>14)?"pliki":"plików"}`}},pt:{dateFormat:"D MMM YYYY",timeFormat:"HH:mm",defaultVaultProfileName:"Predefinido",bootstrap:{downloading:"A transferir idiomas…",continueInEnglish:"Continuar em inglês",downloadFailed:"A transferência dos idiomas falhou. O Notebook Navigator está a usar inglês."},formatters:{"paneHeader.applySortAndGroupToDescendants":t=>`Aplicar ordenação e agrupamento a ${t}`,"paneHeader.applyAppearanceToDescendants":t=>`Aplicar aparência a ${t}`,"paneHeader.resetAppearanceInDescendants":t=>`Repor aparência em ${t}`,"folderAppearance.titleRows.option":t=>`${t} linha${t===1?"":"s"} de título`,"folderAppearance.previewRows.option":t=>`${t} linha${t===1?"":"s"} de pré-visualização`,"modals.bulkApply.applySortAndGroupTitle":t=>`Aplicar ordenação e agrupamento a ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceTitle":t=>`Aplicar aparência a ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceTitle":t=>`Repor aparência em ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceMessage":(t,e)=>`A aparência será alterada para ${t} ${t===1?"item":"itens"}. Aparências personalizadas existentes substituídas: ${e}. As preferências de aparência guardadas são copiadas uma vez; a ordenação e o agrupamento são preservados. Alterações futuras e novos descendentes não ficam associados.`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceMessage":t=>`A aparência será reposta para ${t} ${t===1?"item":"itens"}. A ordenação e o agrupamento são preservados. Esta é uma alteração única; alterações futuras e novos descendentes não ficam associados.`,"modals.bulkApply.affectedCountMessage":t=>`Substituições existentes que serão alteradas: ${t}.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.propertySortMessage":(t,e)=>`Isto muda a vista atual para ordenação manual usando "${t}". Editar a ordem escreve valores de índice numéricos nessa propriedade em ${e} ${e===1?"nota":"notas"} conforme necessário.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.removePropertyMessage":(t,e)=>`Isto remove "${t}" de ${e} ${e===1?"nota":"notas"} na lista atual. A ordem de ordenação manual será apagada para essas notas.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.compactMessage":t=>`Esta reordenação precisa de mais espaço numérico. ${t} ${t===1?"nota receberá":"notas receberão"} novos valores de índice.`,"modals.navRainbowSection.title":t=>`Cores arco-íris: ${t}`,"modals.folderSuggest.placeholder":t=>`Mover ${t} para pasta...`,"modals.folderSuggest.multipleFilesLabel":t=>`${t} ficheiros`}},pt_br:{dateFormat:"DD/MM/YYYY",timeFormat:"HH:mm",defaultVaultProfileName:"Padrão",bootstrap:{downloading:"Baixando idiomas…",continueInEnglish:"Continuar em inglês",downloadFailed:"Não foi possível baixar os idiomas. O Notebook Navigator está usando inglês."},formatters:{"paneHeader.applySortAndGroupToDescendants":t=>`Aplicar classificação e agrupamento a ${t}`,"paneHeader.applyAppearanceToDescendants":t=>`Aplicar aparência a ${t}`,"paneHeader.resetAppearanceInDescendants":t=>`Redefinir aparência em ${t}`,"folderAppearance.titleRows.option":t=>`${t} linha${t===1?"":"s"} de título`,"folderAppearance.previewRows.option":t=>`${t} linha${t===1?"":"s"} de visualização`,"modals.bulkApply.applySortAndGroupTitle":t=>`Aplicar classificação e agrupamento a ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceTitle":t=>`Aplicar aparência a ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceTitle":t=>`Redefinir aparência em ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceMessage":(t,e)=>`A aparência mudará para ${t} ${t===1?"item":"itens"}. Aparências personalizadas existentes substituídas: ${e}. As preferências de aparência salvas são copiadas uma vez; a ordenação e o agrupamento são preservados. Alterações futuras e novos descendentes não ficam vinculados.`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceMessage":t=>`A aparência será redefinida para ${t} ${t===1?"item":"itens"}. A ordenação e o agrupamento são preservados. Esta é uma alteração única; alterações futuras e novos descendentes não ficam vinculados.`,"modals.bulkApply.affectedCountMessage":t=>`Substituições existentes que serão alteradas: ${t}.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.propertySortMessage":(t,e)=>`Isso muda a visualização atual para classificação manual usando "${t}". Editar a ordem grava valores numéricos de índice nessa propriedade em ${e} ${e===1?"nota":"notas"} conforme necessário.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.removePropertyMessage":(t,e)=>`Isso remove "${t}" de ${e} ${e===1?"nota":"notas"} na lista atual. A ordem de classificação manual será limpa para essas notas.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.compactMessage":t=>`Esta reordenação precisa de mais espaço numérico. ${t} ${t===1?"nota receberá":"notas receberão"} novos valores de índice.`,"modals.navRainbowSection.title":t=>`Cores arco-íris: ${t}`,"modals.folderSuggest.placeholder":t=>`Mover ${t} para pasta...`,"modals.folderSuggest.multipleFilesLabel":t=>`${t} arquivos`}},ru:{dateFormat:"D MMMM YYYY",timeFormat:"HH:mm",defaultVaultProfileName:"По умолчанию",bootstrap:{downloading:"Загрузка языков…",continueInEnglish:"Продолжить на английском",downloadFailed:"Не удалось загрузить языки. Notebook Navigator использует английский."},formatters:{"paneHeader.applySortAndGroupToDescendants":t=>`Применить сортировку и группировку для ${t}`,"paneHeader.applyAppearanceToDescendants":t=>`Применить оформление для ${t}`,"paneHeader.resetAppearanceInDescendants":t=>`Сбросить оформление для ${t}`,"folderAppearance.titleRows.option":t=>`${t} ${t===1?"строка":t<5?"строки":"строк"} заголовка`,"folderAppearance.previewRows.option":t=>`${t} ${t===1?"строка":t<5?"строки":"строк"} превью`,"modals.bulkApply.applySortAndGroupTitle":t=>`Применить сортировку и группировку для ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceTitle":t=>`Применить оформление для ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceTitle":t=>`Сбросить оформление для ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceMessage":(t,e)=>`Оформление изменится для ${t} ${t%10===1&&t%100!==11?"элемента":"элементов"}. Заменено существующих индивидуальных оформлений: ${e}. Сохранённые настройки оформления копируются один раз; сортировка и группировка сохраняются. Будущие изменения и новые дочерние элементы не связываются.`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceMessage":t=>`Оформление будет сброшено для ${t} ${t%10===1&&t%100!==11?"элемента":"элементов"}. Сортировка и группировка сохраняются. Это разовое изменение; будущие изменения и новые дочерние элементы не связываются.`,"modals.bulkApply.affectedCountMessage":t=>`Существующих переопределений, которые изменятся: ${t}.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.propertySortMessage":(t,e)=>`Переключает текущий вид на ручную сортировку с использованием «${t}». При изменении порядка числовые значения индекса записываются в это свойство в ${e} ${e%10===1&&e%100!==11?"заметке":"заметках"} по мере необходимости.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.removePropertyMessage":(t,e)=>`Это удалит «${t}» из ${e} ${e%10===1&&e%100!==11?"заметки":"заметок"} в текущем списке. Порядок ручной сортировки будет сброшен для этих заметок.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.compactMessage":t=>`Эта перестановка требует больше числового пространства. ${t} ${t%10===1&&t%100!==11?"заметка получит":t%10>=2&&t%10<=4&&(t%100<12||t%100>14)?"заметки получат":"заметок получат"} новые значения индекса.`,"modals.navRainbowSection.title":t=>`Цвета радуги: ${t}`,"modals.folderSuggest.placeholder":t=>`Переместить ${t} в папку...`,"modals.folderSuggest.multipleFilesLabel":t=>`${t} ${t%10===1&&t%100!==11?"файл":t%10>=2&&t%10<=4&&(t%100<12||t%100>14)?"файла":"файлов"}`}},th:{dateFormat:"D MMM YYYY",timeFormat:"HH:mm",defaultVaultProfileName:"ค่าเริ่มต้น",bootstrap:{downloading:"กำลังดาวน์โหลดภาษา…",continueInEnglish:"ดำเนินการต่อเป็นภาษาอังกฤษ",downloadFailed:"ดาวน์โหลดภาษาไม่สำเร็จ Notebook Navigator กำลังใช้ภาษาอังกฤษ"},formatters:{"paneHeader.applySortAndGroupToDescendants":t=>`ใช้การเรียงและการจัดกลุ่มกับ${t}`,"paneHeader.applyAppearanceToDescendants":t=>`ใช้ลักษณะกับ${t}`,"paneHeader.resetAppearanceInDescendants":t=>`รีเซ็ตลักษณะใน${t}`,"folderAppearance.titleRows.option":t=>`${t} แถวชื่อเรื่อง`,"folderAppearance.previewRows.option":t=>`${t} แถวตัวอย่าง`,"modals.bulkApply.applySortAndGroupTitle":t=>`ใช้การเรียงและการจัดกลุ่มกับ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceTitle":t=>`ใช้ลักษณะกับ${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceTitle":t=>`รีเซ็ตลักษณะใน${t}?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceMessage":(t,e)=>`ลักษณะจะเปลี่ยนสำหรับ ${t} รายการ ลักษณะแบบกำหนดเองเดิมที่จะถูกแทนที่: ${e} ค่าลักษณะที่บันทึกไว้จะถูกคัดลอกครั้งเดียว โดยคงการเรียงลำดับและการจัดกลุ่มไว้ การเปลี่ยนแปลงในอนาคตและรายการย่อยใหม่จะไม่เชื่อมโยงกัน`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceMessage":t=>`ลักษณะจะถูกรีเซ็ตสำหรับ ${t} รายการ โดยคงการเรียงลำดับและการจัดกลุ่มไว้ นี่เป็นการเปลี่ยนแปลงครั้งเดียว การเปลี่ยนแปลงในอนาคตและรายการย่อยใหม่จะไม่เชื่อมโยงกัน`,"modals.bulkApply.affectedCountMessage":t=>`การแทนที่ที่มีอยู่ซึ่งจะเปลี่ยนแปลง: ${t}`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.propertySortMessage":(t,e)=>`จะสลับมุมมองปัจจุบันเป็นการจัดเรียงด้วยตนเองโดยใช้ "${t}" การแก้ไขลำดับจะเขียนค่าดัชนีตัวเลขลงในคุณสมบัตินั้นใน ${e} โน้ต ตามความจำเป็น`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.removePropertyMessage":(t,e)=>`จะลบ "${t}" ออกจาก ${e} โน้ตในรายการปัจจุบัน ลำดับการจัดเรียงด้วยตนเองของโน้ตเหล่านั้นจะถูกล้าง`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.compactMessage":t=>`การจัดเรียงใหม่นี้ต้องการพื้นที่ตัวเลขเพิ่มเติม ${t} โน้ต จะได้รับค่าดัชนีใหม่`,"modals.navRainbowSection.title":t=>`สีรุ้ง: ${t}`,"modals.folderSuggest.placeholder":t=>`ย้าย ${t} ไปยังโฟลเดอร์...`,"modals.folderSuggest.multipleFilesLabel":t=>`${t} ไฟล์`}},tr:{dateFormat:"D MMM YYYY",timeFormat:"HH:mm",defaultVaultProfileName:"Varsayılan",bootstrap:{downloading:"Diller indiriliyor…",continueInEnglish:"İngilizce devam et",downloadFailed:"Diller indirilemedi. Notebook Navigator İngilizce kullanıyor."},formatters:{"paneHeader.applySortAndGroupToDescendants":t=>`Sıralama ve gruplandırmayı ${t} için uygula`,"paneHeader.applyAppearanceToDescendants":t=>`Görünümü ${t} için uygula`,"paneHeader.resetAppearanceInDescendants":t=>`${t} için görünümü sıfırla`,"folderAppearance.titleRows.option":t=>`${t} başlık satırı`,"folderAppearance.previewRows.option":t=>`${t} önizleme satırı`,"modals.bulkApply.applySortAndGroupTitle":t=>`Sıralama ve gruplandırma ${t} için uygulansın mı?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceTitle":t=>`Görünüm ${t} için uygulansın mı?`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceTitle":t=>`${t} için görünüm sıfırlansın mı?`,"modals.bulkApply.applyAppearanceMessage":(t,e)=>`Görünüm ${t} öğe için değişecek. Değiştirilecek mevcut özel görünümler: ${e}. Kayıtlı görünüm tercihleri bir kez kopyalanır; sıralama ve gruplama korunur. Gelecekteki değişiklikler ve yeni alt öğeler bağlanmaz.`,"modals.bulkApply.resetAppearanceMessage":t=>`Görünüm ${t} öğe için sıfırlanacak. Sıralama ve gruplama korunur. Bu tek seferlik bir değişikliktir; gelecekteki değişiklikler ve yeni alt öğeler bağlanmaz.`,"modals.bulkApply.affectedCountMessage":t=>`Değişecek mevcut geçersiz kılmalar: ${t}.`,"modals.manualSortConfirm.propertySortMessage":(t,e)=>`Bu, geçerli görünümü "${t}" kullanarak manuel sıralamaya geçirir. Sıralamayı düzenlemek, gerektiğinde ${e} nottaki bu özelliğe sayısal indeks değerleri yazar.`,"modals.manualSortConfi